e;\">\n<ul><li>All nearby creatures fall victim to the ooze's Fetid Fumes and <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> per turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Fetid_Fumes\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fetid_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Fetid Fumes (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fetid Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Fetid Fumes</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The fumes emanating from the Fetid Ooze eat away at the affected entity, so long as it stays within 2 m (7 ft).</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> at the start of each round.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203243\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2237/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28887/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8129/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.032/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1200233/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   59.684      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   59.684      1 -total\n 58.58%   34.963      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 31.07%   18.542      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 22.29%   13.301  